msgid "Progetto_C50_Halloween_event"
msgstr "Legio Ferrata"

msgid "Progetto_C50_Halloween_event_descr"
msgstr "After trials in the Mirium space, continued usage of the heavy tank Goliath was deemed impractical. Another experimental vehicle, based on the Progetto C50 mod. 66, took its place. The Mirium enhancements on this model proved highly effective, leading to the decision to keep the Legio Ferrata in service for units operating inside the anomaly."

msgid "Progetto_C50_Halloween_event_long_special"
msgstr "A heavy tank with an improved autoreloading system, good gun depression, and sloped frontal armor."

